<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>測試預約</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <section class="screen">
        <div class="card">
            <h1>測試預約 #<%= shortCode %>（僅開發環境）</h1>
            <p>預約編號：<code><%= appointmentId %></code><br>有效期限：<%= notBefore %> ～ <%= expiresAt %></p>
            <p>請用兩個不同的瀏覽器或裝置分別開啟（重新整理此頁連結不變）。兩端畫面左上角都應顯示 <strong>#<%= shortCode %></strong>：</p>
            <p><a href="<%= doctorUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">醫師端連結</a></p>
            <p><a href="<%= patientUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">病患端連結</a></p>
        </div>
    </section>
</body>
</html>
